<title>UK: Forcenergy to buy Great Western Resources.</title>
<headline>Forcenergy to buy Great Western Resources.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Western Resources Inc of the U.S. said on Thursday it had agreed for Forcenergy Inc to buy it in a definitive deal valuing it at about $48.3 million.</p>
<p>The payment equates to about 23p for each Great Western common share outstanding, the Houston-based oil and gas exploration company said in a statement released here.</p>
<p>Great Western's London-listed shares were marked up 2.0p at 21.5p in early trade.</p>
<p>Forcenergy, headquartered in Miami, is an independent oil and gas company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
